---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Elias Velasquez | Systems Engineer & Full-Stack Developer"
  description="Biography, technical capabilities, and engineering background of Elias Velasquez Fuentes - Systems Engineering student at Universidad de Cartagena and Freelance Web Developer."
>
  <main class="page-container about-page">
    <!-- Header Masthead (No generic kickers) -->
    <header class="about-masthead">
      <h1 class="page-title">
        <span data-en="Systems Engineer &" data-es="Ingeniero de Sistemas y">Systems Engineer &</span>
        <strong data-en="Full-Stack Developer." data-es="Desarrollador Full-Stack.">Full-Stack Developer.</strong>
      </h1>

      <p class="masthead-lead" data-en="Final-year Systems Engineering student at Universidad de Cartagena. Bridging computational rigor with front-end craft to build high-performance web platforms, fast booking systems, and relational database architectures." data-es="Estudiante de último año de Ingeniería de Sistemas en la Universidad de Cartagena. Combinando el rigor computacional con el desarrollo front-end para crear plataformas web de alto rendimiento, sistemas de reserva y arquitecturas de bases de datos relacionales.">
        Final-year Systems Engineering student at Universidad de Cartagena. Bridging computational rigor with front-end craft to build high-performance web platforms, fast booking systems, and relational database architectures.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Asymmetric Editorial Grid -->
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <!-- Left: Specifications Dossier -->
      <aside class="specs-dossier" aria-label="Technical Profile & Credentials">
        <h2 class="specs-title" data-en="Engineering Profile" data-es="Perfil de Ingeniería">Engineering Profile</h2>
        
        <dl class="specs-list">
          <div class="spec-row">
            <dt data-en="Education" data-es="Educación">Education</dt>
            <dd>
              <strong>Universidad de Cartagena</strong>
              <span data-en="Systems Engineering (Final Year)" data-es="Ingeniería de Sistemas (Último Año)">Systems Engineering (Final Year)</span>
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="spec-row">
            <dt data-en="Credentials" data-es="Certificaciones">Credentials</dt>
            <dd>
              <strong data-en="3x AWS Academy Graduate" data-es="Graduado 3x AWS Academy">3x AWS Academy Graduate</strong>
              <span data-en="Cloud Architecting, Data Engineering, Cloud Developing" data-es="Arquitectura Cloud, Ingeniería de Datos, Desarrollo Cloud">Cloud Architecting, Data Engineering, Cloud Developing</span>
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="spec-row">
            <dt data-en="Experience" data-es="Experiencia">Experience</dt>
            <dd>
              <strong data-en="Freelance Web Engineering" data-es="Ingeniería Web Freelance">Freelance Web Engineering</strong>
              <span data-en="High-speed booking & event platforms" data-es="Plataformas de reserva y eventos de alta velocidad">High-speed booking & event platforms</span>
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="spec-row">
            <dt data-en="Core Technologies" data-es="Tecnologías Base">Core Technologies</dt>
            <dd class="spec-tags">
              <span class="tech-tag">Astro</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">JavaScript</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">SCSS</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">Supabase</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">Node.js</span>
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="spec-row">
            <dt data-en="Languages" data-es="Idiomas">Languages</dt>
            <dd data-en="English (B2) & Spanish (Native)" data-es="Inglés (B2) y Español (Nativo)">
              English (B2) & Spanish (Native)
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </aside>

      <!-- Right: Narrative & Engineering Focus -->
      <section class="narrative-section">
        <div class="narrative-block">
          <h2 class="section-title" data-en="Perspective & Velocity" data-es="Perspectiva y Velocidad">Perspective & Velocity</h2>
          <p data-en="I build web applications with an engineering-first mindset: prioritizing fast load times, accessible interfaces, structured state management, and reliable data flow. My approach pairs clean component architecture with relational database integrity." data-es="Desarrollo aplicaciones web con mentalidad de ingeniería: priorizando tiempos de carga rápidos, interfaces accesibles, gestión estructurada de estado e integridad en el flujo de datos. Mi enfoque combina arquitectura modular de componentes con bases de datos relacionales.">
            I build web applications with an engineering-first mindset: prioritizing fast load times, accessible interfaces, structured state management, and reliable data flow. My approach pairs clean component architecture with relational database integrity.
          </p>
          <p data-en="During my freelance work for brand launch events ('Original Forever' and 'Hotel Superstar'), I engineered complete web applications that eliminated attendee queuing bottlenecks through instant time-slot reservations, attendee capacity limits, and real-time database confirmations." data-es="En mi experiencia freelance para eventos de lanzamiento ('Original Forever' y 'Hotel Superstar'), desarrollé plataformas web completas que eliminaron cuellos de botella mediante reservas por turnos, control de aforo y confirmaciones en tiempo real en base de datos.">
            During my freelance work for brand launch events ('Original Forever' and 'Hotel Superstar'), I engineered complete web applications that eliminated attendee queuing bottlenecks through instant time-slot reservations, attendee capacity limits, and real-time database confirmations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Capability Areas -->
        <div class="capabilities-block">
          <h2 class="section-title" data-en="Core Capabilities" data-es="Capacidades Principales">Core Capabilities</h2>
          
          <div class="capability-item">
            <div class="capability-header">
              <h3 data-en="Interface Engineering & Performance" data-es="Ingeniería de Interfaces y Rendimiento">Interface Engineering & Performance</h3>
            </div>
            <p data-en="High-speed, responsive, lightweight web applications built with Astro, modern JavaScript, semantic HTML5, and modular SCSS. Zero bloat by default." data-es="Aplicaciones web de alta velocidad, responsivas y ligeras desarrolladas con Astro, JavaScript moderno, HTML5 semántico y SCSS modular.">
              High-speed, responsive, lightweight web applications built with Astro, modern JavaScript, semantic HTML5, and modular SCSS. Zero bloat by default.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="capability-item">
            <div class="capability-header">
              <h3 data-en="Relational Systems & Backend Integration" data-es="Sistemas Relacionales e Integración Backend">Relational Systems & Backend Integration</h3>
            </div>
            <p data-en="Designing normalized PostgreSQL schemas, authentication rules, RESTful endpoints, and real-time event synchronization with Supabase and Node.js." data-es="Diseño de esquemas PostgreSQL normalizados, autenticación segura, endpoints RESTful y sincronización en tiempo real con Supabase y Node.js.">
              Designing normalized PostgreSQL schemas, authentication rules, RESTful endpoints, and real-time event synchronization with Supabase and Node.js.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="capability-item">
            <div class="capability-header">
              <h3 data-en="Cloud Architecture & CI/CD" data-es="Arquitectura Cloud y CI/CD">Cloud Architecture & CI/CD</h3>
            </div>
            <p data-en="Trained in AWS infrastructure, data engineering pipelines, serverless workflows, and robust version control with Git and GitHub." data-es="Formación en infraestructura AWS, pipelines de ingeniería de datos, flujos serverless y control de versiones con Git y GitHub.">
              Trained in AWS infrastructure, data engineering pipelines, serverless workflows, and robust version control with Git and GitHub.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Trajectory / Timeline -->
        <div class="trajectory-block">
          <h2 class="section-title" data-en="Track Record" data-es="Trayectoria">Track Record</h2>

          <div class="timeline-stream">
            <article class="timeline-entry">
              <div class="timeline-meta">
                <span class="timeline-period">2021 — PRESENT</span>
                <span class="timeline-org">Universidad de Cartagena</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="timeline-heading" data-en="Systems Engineering Degree" data-es="Ingeniería de Sistemas">Systems Engineering Degree</h3>
              <p data-en="Senior student focusing on software engineering, database design, distributed logic, and systems architecture." data-es="Estudiante de último año enfocado en ingeniería de software, diseño de bases de datos, lógica distribuida y arquitectura de sistemas.">
                Senior student focusing on software engineering, database design, distributed logic, and systems architecture.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="timeline-entry">
              <div class="timeline-meta">
                <span class="timeline-period">FREELANCE</span>
                <span class="timeline-org" data-en="Brand Event Platforms" data-es="Plataformas de Eventos">Brand Event Platforms</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="timeline-heading" data-en="Web Platforms (&quot;Original Forever&quot; &amp; &quot;Hotel Superstar&quot;)" data-es="Plataformas Web (&quot;Original Forever&quot; y &quot;Hotel Superstar&quot;)">Web Platforms (&quot;Original Forever&quot; &amp; &quot;Hotel Superstar&quot;)</h3>
              <p data-en="Engineered high-concurrency reservation platforms and attendee management dashboards, connecting custom front-end interfaces with live Supabase and PostgreSQL backends." data-es="Desarrollo de plataformas de reserva y gestión de aforo para eventos de lanzamiento, conectando interfaces front-end con backends en Supabase y PostgreSQL.">
                Engineered high-concurrency reservation platforms and attendee management dashboards, connecting custom front-end interfaces with live Supabase and PostgreSQL backends.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Links -->
        <div class="about-actions">
          <a class="impact-link" href="/work">
            <span data-en="See Case Studies & Live Demos" data-es="Ver Casos de Estudio y Demos">See Case Studies & Live Demos</span>
          </a>
          <a class="secondary-action" href="/contact">
            <span data-en="Get in Touch" data-es="Contáctame">Get in Touch</span>
          </a>
        </div>

      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
